# Who this brief is for

Copy this file to prompts/profile.md (gitignored) and describe yourself.
The research run reads it every morning, so be specific.

- Name, what you study, year, where you live (city / area).
- Your skills (languages, frameworks) and what you are learning.
- Internship interest: which roles, which locations (city / India / remote), which companies are especially welcome.
- News interest: which country / region, which topics matter.
- Anything you never want to see.
